| Gingival Display | Etiology | Treatment |
| --- | --- | --- |
| < 4 mm | **E1** | Altered passive eruption Gingival enlargement Thick gingival phenotype | **T1** | Gingivectomy Gingivoplasty |
| 3 - 6 mm | **E2** | Hypermobile (hyperactive) upper lip Short upper lip (< 20 mm) | **T2** | Lip repositioning Botulinum toxin injections |
| 4 - 8 mm | **E3** | Dentoalveolar extrusion Deep bite | **T3** | Orthodontic therapy Osteotomy |
| > 8 mm | **E4** | Vertical maxillary excess (VME) | **T4** | Le Fort I osteotomy |

